  {
    "slide": 35,
    "text": "Only a zygote is truly totipotent; it is considered unethical to obtain stem cells from this source.\nPluripotent stem cells, however, can easily be obtained from adult tissues. \nExtra: Stem Cell Ethics\n(More on this in Ch. 18)\nhttps://www.genome.gov/25020028/cloning-fact-sheet/",
    "raw_slide_sha256": "0063c53b2f993e215f5133285fe188c503496512c404195103095354661ce28b",
